{
  "_doc": [
    "Subject catalogue template — subjects per standard (grade) per programme.",
    "Fill one 'programmes' entry per board/medium track. Convert to the",
    "onboarding YAML's `subjects:` + `offerings:` sections with:",
    "  PYTHONPATH=. python scripts/subject_catalogue_to_yaml.py scripts/schools/<file>.json",
    "Keys starting with '_' are documentation and are ignored by the converter.",
    "",
    "Field reference (mirrors seed_service / SubjectContext):",
    "  programme.code / name / board / medium  -> academic_programmes natural keys",
    "  catalogue[].code       -> subjects.code (unique per tenant; quote to keep leading zeros)",
    "  catalogue[].name       -> subjects.name",
    "  catalogue[].description-> subjects.description (optional; e.g. native-script name)",
    "  catalogue[].subject_type -> core | elective | language | activity | co_curricular | other (optional)",
    "  catalogue[].role       -> first_language | second_language | third_language | core | co_curricular (optional)",
    "  catalogue[].short_code -> short display code (optional)",
    "  standards[].grade      -> grades.name (must exist in the school YAML's grades list)",
    "  standards[].subjects[] -> { code, weekly, type } — type: mandatory | elective (default mandatory)",
    "  standards[].subjects[] may override role/short_code per (programme, grade)."
  ],
  "programmes": [
